{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "url": "/assets/data/open-weights-runs.json"
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "filter": "isValid(datum.cost)"
    }
  ],
  "spacing": 0,
  "facet": {
    "field": "harness",
    "type": "nominal",
    "title": null,
    "sort": [
      "Shell",
      "Incalmo",
      "Artemis"
    ],
    "columns": 3,
    "header": {
      "labelExpr": "''",
      "labelPadding": 0
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "width": 240,
    "height": 300,
    "layer": [
      {
        "_comment": [
          "Rings Incalmo only - the harness the post is arguing for. Its sides land",
          "in the two gutters, where the dividers used to be, just turned up and",
          "joined at the ends.",
          "Every number here is measured rather than derived, because each one moves",
          "the thing it is being measured against. Horizontally: reaching into the",
          "gutter counts towards the panel's bounds, and the facet layout",
          "(bounds:full) widens the gutter to match, so -26 with spacing 0 is the",
          "fixed point - ~50px gutters with the sides centred in them. Vertically:",
          "while the rect is the lowest thing in the panel the x axis is placed off",
          "its bounds and follows it down, so the axis offset below and this y2 have",
          "to be solved together. child_height - 2 with offset -51 puts the axis line",
          "on zero and leaves ~13px under the Cost title. Re-measure both together if",
          "either changes."
        ],
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "n"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "harness"
            ]
          },
          {
            "filter": "datum.harness === 'Incalmo'"
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "rect",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "fill": null,
          "stroke": "$hairline-strong",
          "strokeWidth": 1.5,
          "x": {
            "expr": "-26"
          },
          "x2": {
            "expr": "child_width + 26"
          },
          "y": {
            "expr": "-14"
          },
          "y2": {
            "expr": "child_height - 2"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "cost",
                "as": "meanCost"
              },
              {
                "op": "stdev",
                "field": "cost",
                "as": "stdCost"
              },
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "exfiltrated",
                "as": "meanGoals"
              },
              {
                "op": "stdev",
                "field": "exfiltrated",
                "as": "stdGoals"
              },
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "runs"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "model",
              "harness"
            ]
          },
          {
            "calculate": "max(0, datum.meanCost - datum.stdCost)",
            "as": "x0"
          },
          {
            "calculate": "datum.meanCost + datum.stdCost",
            "as": "x1"
          },
          {
            "calculate": "max(0, datum.meanGoals - datum.stdGoals)",
            "as": "y0"
          },
          {
            "calculate": "min(100, datum.meanGoals + datum.stdGoals)",
            "as": "y1"
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "rect",
          "opacity": 0.22,
          "strokeWidth": 1
        },
        "encoding": {
          "x": {
            "field": "x0",
            "type": "quantitative"
          },
          "x2": {
            "field": "x1"
          },
          "y": {
            "field": "y0",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "scale": {
              "domain": [
                -22,
                116
              ]
            }
          },
          "y2": {
            "field": "y1"
          },
          "color": {
            "field": "model",
            "type": "nominal",
            "title": "Model",
            "sort": [
              "GLM 5.2",
              "Kimi K3",
              "Qwen 3.8 Max"
            ],
            "legend": {
              "orient": "bottom",
              "direction": "horizontal",
              "columns": 0
            }
          },
          "stroke": {
            "field": "model",
            "type": "nominal",
            "sort": [
              "GLM 5.2",
              "Kimi K3",
              "Qwen 3.8 Max"
            ],
            "legend": null
          },
          "tooltip": [
            {
              "field": "model",
              "title": "Model"
            },
            {
              "field": "harness",
              "title": "Harness"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanCost",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": "$,.2f",
              "title": "Mean cost / run"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanGoals",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": ".1f",
              "title": "Mean % goals achieved"
            },
            {
              "field": "runs",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "title": "Runs"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "cost",
                "as": "meanCost"
              },
              {
                "op": "mean",
                "field": "exfiltrated",
                "as": "meanGoals"
              },
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "runs"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "model",
              "harness",
              "env",
              "hosts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "calculate": "datum.env + ' (' + datum.hosts + ')'",
            "as": "envLabel"
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "point",
          "filled": true,
          "size": 70,
          "opacity": 0.8
        },
        "encoding": {
          "x": {
            "field": "meanCost",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "Cost",
            "scale": {
              "zero": true
            },
            "axis": {
              "format": "$,.0f",
              "tickCount": 4,
              "offset": -51.0,
              "_comment": "Negative: pulls the axis up into the plot area so the box can enclose it, and leaves no empty band between the y axis's 0 and the x axis. Solved together with the ring's y2 - see the comment on that layer."
            }
          },
          "y": {
            "field": "meanGoals",
            "type": "quantitative",
            "title": "% goals achieved",
            "scale": {
              "domain": [
                -22,
                116
              ]
            },
            "axis": {
              "values": [
                0,
                20,
                40,
                60,
                80,
                100
              ],
              "domain": false,
              "offset": 14,
              "_comment": "Positive: pushes the shared y axis away from the first panel. It is the axis for all three, but sitting flush against Shell it read as Shell's own."
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "field": "model",
            "type": "nominal",
            "title": "Model",
            "sort": [
              "GLM 5.2",
              "Kimi K3",
              "Qwen 3.8 Max"
            ],
            "legend": {
              "orient": "bottom",
              "direction": "horizontal",
              "columns": 0
            }
          },
          "tooltip": [
            {
              "field": "model",
              "title": "Model"
            },
            {
              "field": "harness",
              "title": "Harness"
            },
            {
              "field": "envLabel",
              "title": "Environment"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanCost",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": "$,.2f",
              "title": "Mean cost / run"
            },
            {
              "field": "meanGoals",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": ".1f",
              "title": "Mean % goals achieved"
            },
            {
              "field": "runs",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "title": "Runs"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "_comment": [
          "The panel name, in pixel coordinates inside the plot area.",
          "Anything drawn outside it pushes Vega's own labels further out,",
          "so this is the only place a mark and a title can share a box."
        ],
        "transform": [
          {
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "op": "count",
                "as": "n"
              }
            ],
            "groupby": [
              "harness"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "mark": {
          "type": "text",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": 700,
          "baseline": "middle",
          "align": "center",
          "color": "$ink",
          "x": {
            "expr": "child_width / 2"
          },
          "y": {
            "expr": "16"
          }
        },
        "encoding": {
          "text": {
            "field": "harness"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "_fitPanels": 3
}
